    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mtext>terms</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math>-terms <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&